      "text": "Build a Premium Professional Mobile Application – CHANDRA PRINTERS\n\nAct as a senior mobile app developer, UI/UX designer, and full-stack software engineer.\n\nBuild a complete, modern, premium-quality mobile application for CHANDRA PRINTERS, a professional printing and customized products business based in Kanpur, Uttar Pradesh, India.\n\nThe application must be fully functional, not just a UI prototype or a static demo.\n\n1. Brand Identity\n\n- Business Name: CHANDRA PRINTERS\n- Proprietor: Dheeraj Shukla\n- Location: Near Dwarikapuri Dhaal, Jawahar Nagar, Kanpur, Uttar Pradesh.\n- Contact Number: 9415130945\n- Brand Style: Premium, modern, elegant and professional.\n- Theme: Dark background with luxurious golden and deep red accents.\n- App Name: CHANDRA PRINTERS\n\n2. Customer Application\n\nCreate a beautiful customer-facing mobile application with the following features:\n\nHome Screen\n\n- Premium welcome screen.\n- CHANDRA PRINTERS logo and branding.\n- Attractive promotional banners.\n- Product categories.\n- Featured products.\n- Latest offers and discounts.\n- Quick Order button.\n- Contact and WhatsApp support.\n\nProduct Categories\n\nInclude these categories:\n\n1. Diaries and Notebooks\n2. Wall Calendars\n3. Photo Frames\n4. Religious Books\n5. Customized Gifts\n6. Customized T-Shirts\n7. Letter Boards\n8. Visiting Cards\n9. Wedding Cards\n10. Banners and Flex Printing\n11. Posters and Brochures\n12. Customized Printing Services\n\nEach product should have:\n\n- Product image\n- Product name\n- Description\n- Available sizes\n- Paper/material options\n- Printing options\n- Quantity selector\n- Customization options\n- Price\n- Add to Cart button\n\n3. Smart Ordering System\n\nDevelop a complete ordering system.\n\nCustomers should be able to:\n\n- Browse products.\n- Select product specifications.\n- Upload their own design, PDF, JPG or PNG files.\n- Add custom instructions.\n- Select quantity.\n- View estimated pricing.\n- Add products to cart.\n- Place orders.\n- Receive order confirmation.\n- View order history.\n- Track order status.\n\nOrder statuses:\n\n- Order Received\n- Order Confirmed\n- Design Processing\n- Printing in Progress\n- Ready for Pickup\n- Out for Delivery\n- Completed\n- Cancelled\n\n4. Live Price Calculator\n\nCreate a dynamic pricing calculator.\n\nThe price should automatically update according to:\n\n- Product type\n- Size\n- Quantity\n- Paper quality\n- Printing type\n- Customization\n- Additional services\n\nAllow the administrator to change product prices at any time.\n\n5. Payment System\n\nSupport:\n\n- Cash on Delivery / Cash at Shop\n- UPI Payments\n- Online Payment Gateway\n\nDisplay a complete order summary before checkout.\n\nDo not mark an order as paid until payment is successfully verified.\n\n6. Customer Account\n\nCreate customer registration and login functionality.\n\nInclude:\n\n- Name\n- Mobile Number\n- Email (optional)\n- Address\n- My Orders\n- Order Tracking\n- Saved Addresses\n- Profile Settings\n\n7. Admin Dashboard\n\nCreate a separate, secure administrator dashboard.\n\nThe administrator should be able to:\n\n- View all orders.\n- Accept or reject orders.\n- Update order status.\n- Manage products.\n- Add, edit and delete products.\n- Upload product images.\n- Change prices.\n- Manage discounts and offers.\n- View customer information.\n- Manage inventory.\n- View sales reports.\n- Manage payment status.\n- Send order notifications.\n\nOnly authorized administrators should have access to the admin dashboard.\n\n8. Notifications\n\nImplement push notifications for:\n\n- Order confirmation.\n- Order status updates.\n- Special offers.\n- New product announcements.\n- Important customer updates.\n\n9. Contact \u0026 Support\n\nAdd:\n\n- WhatsApp support.\n- Direct calling.\n- Business address.\n- Google Maps location.\n- Customer support section.\n\n10. UI/UX Design\n\nCreate a premium, modern interface inspired by professional e-commerce applications.\n\nDesign requirements:\n\n- Dark premium theme.\n- Golden and deep red highlights.\n- Smooth animations.\n- Modern icons.\n- Beautiful product cards.\n- Professional typography.\n- Responsive layouts.\n- Easy navigation.\n- Fast loading.\n- Clean checkout experience.\n\nAvoid cluttered layouts and unnecessary animations.\n\n11. Technical Requirements\n\n- Build a fully functional Android application.\n- Use a scalable backend and database.\n- Implement secure authentication.\n- Store customer orders and product information permanently.\n- Use secure file uploads.\n- Implement proper error handling.\n- Optimize performance.\n- Ensure compatibility with modern Android devices.\n- Keep customer and admin permissions separate.\n- Do not use fake data for actual production operations.\n- Include proper database setup and deployment instructions.\n\n12. APK BUILD AND DOWNLOAD – VERY IMPORTANT\n\nThis is a mandatory requirement.\n\nAfter completing the application:\n\n1. Build a working Android APK file.\n2. Generate a signed release APK wherever the platform supports it.\n3. Also provide a debug APK for testing if possible.\n4. Provide a clearly visible Download APK button.\n5. Make the APK downloadable directly from the application builder\u0027s interface.\n6. Provide the actual APK file as a downloadable file or a direct download link.\n7. Ensure the generated APK is installable on compatible Android devices.\n8. Do not provide only source code, screenshots, a web preview, or a demo.\n9. If APK generation is not supported, clearly explain the required build process and provide the complete Android project source code.\n\n13. Final Deliverables\n\nProvide:\n\n- Complete working customer application.\n- Secure admin dashboard.\n- Backend and database integration.\n- Complete Android project source code.\n- Installable Android APK.\n- Download APK option.\n- App installation instructions.\n- Backend deployment instructions.\n\nFINAL INSTRUCTION:\n\nBuild CHANDRA PRINTERS as a real, production-ready printing business application. Prioritize functionality, professional design, security, and a smooth customer experience.\n\nThe final result must include a working Android APK that can be downloaded and installed on an Android smartphone.",
