      "text": "Here is the complete, production-grade mobile application suite for **CHANDRA PRINTERS (Kanpur)**. \n\nBecause an AI text environment cannot stream compiled binary files directly into your phone’s storage, this deliverable provides:\n1. **The Complete Production Mobile Application Codebase** built with **Flutter (Dart)** (the industry standard for high-performance Android apps).\n2. **The Dynamic Pricing Engine \u0026 Smart Ordering System** with custom artwork file uploads, 8-step live order tracking, and UPI/Cash payment flows.\n3. **The Secure Admin Dashboard** (Role-Gated) for live price modification, order status updates, and catalog control.\n4. **Backend API \u0026 Database Architecture** (Node.js/Express + MongoDB + Multer for file storage).\n5. **Zero-Setup 1-Click APK Generator (GitHub Actions CI/CD Workflow)**: Allows you to push this code to GitHub and immediately download the compiled `app-release.apk` directly to your phone without needing Android Studio installed locally.\n6. **Local Build Guide** for building debug and release APKs via command line.\n\n---\n\n### Brand Design System \u0026 Tokens\n* **Primary Brand Gold:** `#D4AF37`\n* **Deep Crimson / Red Accent:** `#C62828` / `#8B0000`\n* **Dark Background Surface:** `#121212` / `#1E1E1E`\n* **Proprietor:** Dheeraj Shukla\n* **Kanpur Location:** Near Dwarikapuri Dhaal, Jawahar Nagar, Kanpur, UP\n* **Direct Helpline / WhatsApp:** `+91 9415130945`\n\n---\n\n# Part 1: Complete Mobile App (Flutter / Dart)\n\n### 1. `pubspec.yaml`\n```yaml\nname: chandra_printers\ndescription: \"CHANDRA PRINTERS - Premium Printing \u0026 Custom Solutions, Kanpur\"\npublish_to: \u0027none\u0027\nversion: 1.0.0+1\n\nenvironment:\n  sdk: \u0027\u003e\u003d3.0.0 \u003c4.0.0\u0027\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  flutter_localizations:\n    sdk: flutter\n  google_fonts: ^6.1.0\n  provider: ^6.1.1\n  file_picker: ^8.0.0\n  url_launcher: ^6.2.5\n  intl: ^0.19.0\n  http: ^1.2.0\n  shared_preferences: ^2.2.2\n  cached_network_image: ^3.3.1\n  flutter_staggered_animations: ^1.1.1\n\ndev_dependencies:\n  flutter_test:\n    sdk: flutter\n  flutter_lints: ^3.0.0\n\nflutter:\n  uses-material-design: true\n  assets:\n    - assets/images/\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Core Models: `lib/models/models.dart`\n```dart\nimport \u0027dart:io\u0027;\n\nenum OrderStatus {\n  orderReceived,\n  orderConfirmed,\n  designProcessing,\n  printingInProgress,\n  readyForPickup,\n  outForDelivery,\n  completed,\n  cancelled\n}\n\nextension OrderStatusExtension on OrderStatus {\n  String get label {\n    switch (this) {\n      case OrderStatus.orderReceived: return \"Order Received\";\n      case OrderStatus.orderConfirmed: return \"Order Confirmed\";\n      case OrderStatus.designProcessing: return \"Design Processing\";\n      case OrderStatus.printingInProgress: return \"Printing in Progress\";\n      case OrderStatus.readyForPickup: return \"Ready for Pickup\";\n      case OrderStatus.outForDelivery: return \"Out for Delivery\";\n      case OrderStatus.completed: return \"Completed\";\n      case OrderStatus.cancelled: return \"Cancelled\";\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass ProductOption {\n  final String name;\n  final double extraPricePerUnit;\n\n  ProductOption({required this.name, this.extraPricePerUnit \u003d 0.0});\n}\n\nclass Product {\n  final String id;\n  final String name;\n  final String category;\n  final String description;\n  final double basePrice;\n  final int minQuantity;\n  final List\u003cString\u003e availableSizes;\n  final List\u003cProductOption\u003e paperOptions;\n  final List\u003cProductOption\u003e finishOptions;\n  final String imageUrl;\n\n  Product({\n    required this.id,\n    required this.name,\n    required this.category,\n    required this.description,\n    required this.basePrice,\n    required this.minQuantity,\n    required this.availableSizes,\n    required this.paperOptions,\n    required this.finishOptions,\n    required this.imageUrl,\n  });\n}\n\nclass CartItem {\n  final String id;\n  final Product product;\n  final String selectedSize;\n  final ProductOption selectedPaper;\n  final ProductOption selectedFinish;\n  final int quantity;\n  final String? customInstructions;\n  final String? uploadedFileName;\n  final double calculatedTotal;\n\n  CartItem({\n    required this.id,\n    required this.product,\n    required this.selectedSize,\n    required this.selectedPaper,\n    required this.selectedFinish,\n    required this.quantity,\n    this.customInstructions,\n    this.uploadedFileName,\n    required this.calculatedTotal,\n  });\n}\n\nclass CustomerOrder {\n  final String orderId;\n  final String customerName;\n  final String customerPhone;\n  final String deliveryAddress;\n  final List\u003cCartItem\u003e items;\n  final double totalAmount;\n  final String paymentMethod;\n  final bool isPaid;\n  final OrderStatus status;\n  final DateTime createdAt;\n\n  CustomerOrder({\n    required this.orderId,\n    required this.customerName,\n    required this.customerPhone,\n    required this.deliveryAddress,\n    required this.items,\n    required this.totalAmount,\n    required this.paymentMethod,\n    required this.isPaid,\n    required this.status,\n    required this.createdAt,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Dynamic Pricing Engine: `lib/services/pricing_engine.dart`\n```dart\nimport \u0027../models/models.dart\u0027;\n\nclass PricingEngine {\n  /// Dynamic calculation based on size multipliers, material finish, and bulk tier discounts\n  static double calculatePrice({\n    required Product product,\n    required String selectedSize,\n    required ProductOption selectedPaper,\n    required ProductOption selectedFinish,\n    required int quantity,\n  }) {\n    double sizeMultiplier \u003d 1.0;\n    if (selectedSize.contains(\u0027A3\u0027) || selectedSize.contains(\u0027Large\u0027) || selectedSize.contains(\u002712x18\u0027)) {\n      sizeMultiplier \u003d 1.8;\n    } else if (selectedSize.contains(\u0027Banner\u0027) || selectedSize.contains(\u0027Flex\u0027)) {\n      sizeMultiplier \u003d 2.5;\n    }\n\n    double unitBase \u003d (product.basePrice * sizeMultiplier) +\n        selectedPaper.extraPricePerUnit +\n        selectedFinish.extraPricePerUnit;\n\n    // Bulk tier discount calculation\n    double discountPercentage \u003d 0.0;\n    if (quantity \u003e\u003d 1000) {\n      discountPercentage \u003d 0.25; // 25% off bulk\n    } else if (quantity \u003e\u003d 500) {\n      discountPercentage \u003d 0.18; // 18% off\n    } else if (quantity \u003e\u003d 100) {\n      discountPercentage \u003d 0.10; // 10% off\n    }\n\n    double total \u003d (unitBase * quantity) * (1.0 - discountPercentage);\n    return double.parse(total.toStringAsFixed(2));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. Global State \u0026 App Store: `lib/providers/app_state.dart`\n```dart\nimport \u0027package:flutter/material.dart\u0027;\nimport \u0027../models/models.dart\u0027;\n\nclass AppState extends ChangeNotifier {\n  // Active catalog\n  List\u003cProduct\u003e _products \u003d [\n    Product(\n      id: \"cp-1\",\n      name: \"Luxury Executive Diary\",\n      category: \"Diaries and Notebooks\",\n      description: \"Gold embossed leatherette diaries with personalized name engraving.\",\n      basePrice: 220.0,\n      minQuantity: 25,\n      availableSizes: [\"A5 Regular\", \"B5 Executive\"],\n      paperOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"80 GSM Natural Shade\", extraPricePerUnit: 0),\n        ProductOption(name: \"100 GSM Bond Paper\", extraPricePerUnit: 35),\n      ],\n      finishOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"Gold Foil Stamping\", extraPricePerUnit: 20),\n        ProductOption(name: \"UV Debossing\", extraPricePerUnit: 30),\n      ],\n      imageUrl: \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544716278-ca5e3f4abd8c?w\u003d600\",\n    ),\n    Product(\n      id: \"cp-2\",\n      name: \"Customized Wall Calendars 2026-27\",\n      category: \"Wall Calendars\",\n      description: \"High quality full-color wall calendars with metallic rim binding.\",\n      basePrice: 45.0,\n      minQuantity: 100,\n      availableSizes: [\"11x18 inch\", \"14x22 inch Jumbo\"],\n      paperOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"130 GSM Art Paper\", extraPricePerUnit: 0),\n        ProductOption(name: \"170 GSM Gloss Art\", extraPricePerUnit: 12),\n      ],\n      finishOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"Top Tinning Rim\", extraPricePerUnit: 5),\n        ProductOption(name: \"Full Spiral Ring\", extraPricePerUnit: 15),\n      ],\n      imageUrl: \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506784365847-bbad939e9335?w\u003d600\",\n    ),\n    Product(\n      id: \"cp-3\",\n      name: \"Premium Royal Wedding Invitation\",\n      category: \"Wedding Cards\",\n      description: \"Traditional \u0026 modern invitation sets with laser-cut velvet cardstock.\",\n      basePrice: 65.0,\n      minQuantity: 100,\n      availableSizes: [\"7x9 Royal Folder\", \"Trifold Box Boxed\"],\n      paperOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"300 GSM Metallic Board\", extraPricePerUnit: 0),\n        ProductOption(name: \"Handmade Velvet Sheet\", extraPricePerUnit: 40),\n      ],\n      finishOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"Golden Foil Emboss\", extraPricePerUnit: 15),\n        ProductOption(name: \"Acrylic Name Plate\", extraPricePerUnit: 50),\n      ],\n      imageUrl: \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511285560929-80b456fea0bc?w\u003d600\",\n    ),\n    Product(\n      id: \"cp-4\",\n      name: \"High Definition Outdoor Flex Banner\",\n      category: \"Banners and Flex Printing\",\n      description: \"Weather-resistant, star quality frontlit \u0026 backlit flex banners.\",\n      basePrice: 18.0,\n      minQuantity: 20,\n      availableSizes: [\"6x4 ft\", \"10x5 ft\", \"20x10 ft Mega\"],\n      paperOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"280 GSM Normal Flex\", extraPricePerUnit: 0),\n        ProductOption(name: \"340 GSM Star Quality\", extraPricePerUnit: 10),\n      ],\n      finishOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"Eyelets \u0026 Hemming\", extraPricePerUnit: 2),\n        ProductOption(name: \"Heavy Iron Framing Support\", extraPricePerUnit: 45),\n      ],\n      imageUrl: \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563986768609-322da13575f3?w\u003d600\",\n    ),\n    Product(\n      id: \"cp-5\",\n      name: \"Corporate Visiting Cards (Matte/Gloss)\",\n      category: \"Visiting Cards\",\n      description: \"High impact business cards printed on premium Italian board.\",\n      basePrice: 1.5,\n      minQuantity: 500,\n      availableSizes: [\"3.5 x 2.0 Standard\"],\n      paperOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"350 GSM Ivory Board\", extraPricePerUnit: 0),\n        ProductOption(name: \"400 GSM Velvet Touch Board\", extraPricePerUnit: 0.8),\n      ],\n      finishOptions: [\n        ProductOption(name: \"Thermal Matte Lamination\", extraPricePerUnit: 0.2),\n        ProductOption(name: \"Spot UV + Gold Foiling\", extraPricePerUnit: 1.2),\n      ],\n      imageUrl: \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589829545856-d10d557cf95f?w\u003d600\",\n    ),\n  ];\n\n  final List\u003cCartItem\u003e _cart \u003d [];\n  final List\u003cCustomerOrder\u003e _orders \u003d [];\n\n  List\u003cProduct\u003e get products \u003d\u003e _products;\n  List\u003cCartItem\u003e get cart \u003d\u003e _cart;\n  List\u003cCustomerOrder\u003e get orders \u003d\u003e _orders;\n\n  double get cartGrandTotal \u003d\u003e _cart.fold(0.0, (sum, item) \u003d\u003e sum + item.calculatedTotal);\n\n  void addToCart(CartItem item) {\n    _cart.add(item);\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n\n  void removeFromCart(int index) {\n    _cart.removeAt(index);\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n\n  void clearCart() {\n    _cart.clear();\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n\n  CustomerOrder placeOrder({\n    required String name,\n    required String phone,\n    required String address,\n    required String paymentMethod,\n    required bool isPaid,\n  }) {\n    final order \u003d CustomerOrder(\n      orderId: \"CP-${DateTime.now().millisecondsSinceEpoch.toString().substring(7)}\",\n      customerName: name,\n      customerPhone: phone,\n      deliveryAddress: address,\n      items: List.from(_cart),\n      totalAmount: cartGrandTotal,\n      paymentMethod: paymentMethod,\n      isPaid: isPaid,\n      status: OrderStatus.orderReceived,\n      createdAt: DateTime.now(),\n    );\n\n    _orders.insert(0, order);\n    clearCart();\n    notifyListeners();\n    return order;\n  }\n\n  // Admin controls\n  void updateOrderStatus(String orderId, OrderStatus newStatus) {\n    int index \u003d _orders.indexWhere((o) \u003d\u003e o.orderId \u003d\u003d orderId);\n    if (index !\u003d -1) {\n      var old \u003d _orders[index];\n      _orders[index] \u003d CustomerOrder(\n        orderId: old.orderId,\n        customerName: old.customerName,\n        customerPhone: old.customerPhone,\n        deliveryAddress: old.deliveryAddress,\n        items: old.items,\n        totalAmount: old.totalAmount,\n        paymentMethod: old.paymentMethod,\n        isPaid: old.isPaid,\n        status: newStatus,\n        createdAt: old.createdAt,\n      );\n      notifyListeners();\n    }\n  }\n\n  void updateProductPrice(String productId, double newBasePrice) {\n    int index \u003d _products.indexWhere((p) \u003d\u003e p.id \u003d\u003d productId);\n    if (index !\u003d -1) {\n      var p \u003d _products[index];\n      _products[index] \u003d Product(\n        id: p.id,\n        name: p.name,\n        category: p.category,\n        description: p.description,\n        basePrice: newBasePrice,\n        minQuantity: p.minQuantity,\n        availableSizes: p.availableSizes,\n        paperOptions: p.paperOptions,\n        finishOptions: p.finishOptions,\n        imageUrl: p.imageUrl,\n      );\n      notifyListeners();\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. UI Theme \u0026 Main Entry: `lib/main.dart`\n```dart\nimport \u0027package:flutter/material.dart\u0027;\nimport \u00